WEBVTT

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:24.910
You fool.

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:28.870
You should have abandoned
this spineless human.

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.700
Yuliy, run.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:33.660
Yeah, I will...

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.080
But with you, Philip!

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.260
Now, let's finish this.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.240
Ready!

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:13.040
Fire.

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:19.880
Fire! Don't stop!

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:23.050
Don't give the monsters
the chance to strike back!

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:28.550
The special bullets supplied by V Shipping
are very effective.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:35.060
What's going on?

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:37.890
-Looks like luck's turning in our favor.
-What?

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.020
The army, huh?

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:45.070
Perhaps even your proud kind
might lose to them.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:47.490
It's not a significant threat.

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:50.660
I'll let you handle him.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:54.830
It's a pity that I won't get to watch
two Sirius kill each other.

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:57.120
You heard him.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:04.630
Why?

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:09.010
Why is the army firing guns
at my property?

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:09.930
Father!

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:13.010
-It's too dangerous out there.
-I need to talk to the commander.

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.520
They think they are in Lushun
or something.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:35.120
Now, Mr. Willard...

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:38.210
We've mobilized a unit of this scale

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:41.330
to settle the incident
from the drill in Fuji.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:43.290
So the executive of Alma,

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:47.630
the one who tried to sell our army
a monster they called a "secret weapon",

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:48.840
had better be here.

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:51.510
Yes.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:53.390
Of course.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.230
Come on.

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:07.860
If you don't attack me
with the intent to kill, you will die.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:09.490
I will not kill.

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:14.530
You might be a Vampire,
but you're still my older brother!

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:20.330
You're too soft.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:25.290
Just as I thought.
You're not cut out to be an avenger.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:28.130
Then who is?

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:32.180
I'm the only one who can get revenge
for Mother and the villagers!

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:35.470
And exterminating the Vampires
will complete your revenge?

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:38.680
You really think that?

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:44.600
They will certainly get to it
before you kill them all.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:46.770
What do you mean by "it"?

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.070
The Ark of Sirius.

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.110
But the Ark is already...

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:52.070
That's right.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:54.570
It had already left Dogville 10 years ago.

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:56.870
Why do you think that is?

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.290
That's...

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:00.580
It's Father who took it.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:02.870
Father?

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:04.330
Why?

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.340
Yuliy.

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:13.930
You're the only Sirius that survived.

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:20.390
Do something that only you can do.
Something that I, a Vampire, cannot do.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.730
-What are you saying?
-Yuliy...

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:24.810
Survive.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:27.940
Mikhail?

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.650
-Brother?
-Yuliy.

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:31.610
-Philip.
-Over here.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:34.030
-Take care of him.
-Yuliy.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:42.500
These low-level humans
should know their place.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:48.790
Willard.

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:53.840
Professor Willard. What a surprise...

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.470
I could not believe it

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:59.810
when I heard there was a Sirius survivor
among the Jaegers.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:03.930
But it all makes sense
if you are the owner.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.850
You've aged a bit, professor.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.900
But what should I have expected?

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:12.610
Ten years is a long time for you humans.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:15.360
Yes, it certainly was a long time...

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:17.410
Kershner.

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.040
I think you should have
minded your own business

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.500
and kept your teaching job.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:37.680
-Professor?
-I wasn't expecting you to come.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.590
Is Mikhail dead?

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:42.100
He vanished.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.890
He chose to save his
younger brother's life

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.940
over his loyalty to us.

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:50.730
What a useless dog.

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.230
Shut up. Step away from the professor.

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:55.820
Look how loyal he is to you.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:06:00.070
How did you, his enemy,
manage to tame him?

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.330
What are you talking about?

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.500
This is too good to be true!

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:14.300
Professor, you are one filthy bastard!

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:21.390
I have no choice. I shall speak
on behalf of your silent owner...

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:23.390
Be thankful.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:26.310
Long, long ago,

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:28.890
we acquired an ancient document.

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:32.610
It described what the Ark of Sirius was.

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:37.280
The document mentioned the place
where the Ark was to be found.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.360
And that place was Dogville.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.330
Don't you remember?

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:47.790
Your village was engulfed
in beautiful flames then,

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:48.870
just like today.

00:06:58.590 --> 00:06:59.590
You...

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:01.510
You did it!

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:07.350
Don't be hasty.

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:09.680
I'm not done talking.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:14.520
Deciphering the old document
was quite difficult.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:19.280
So, we decided to get the help
of a human archaeologist.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:21.360
He was a poor scholar

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:24.620
who was passionately searching
for the Ark of Sirius.

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:27.540
When I offered to fund his research,

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:29.250
he snapped at the opportunity.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.620
You were so grateful to us, weren't you?

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:36.920
He really worked hard for us.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:40.590
And because he was able to decipher
the old document,

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:43.260
we were able to discover Dogville.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:45.640
You get the picture now?

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:48.930
Impossible...

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:51.270
You're one dumb dog.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:52.810
That's a lie.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:54.480
The professor?

00:07:58.650 --> 00:07:59.990
He's telling the truth.

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:06.160
You're a lucky Sirius survivor.

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:10.500
You have two enemies before you tonight.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.840
Finally, you show your true identity.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:42.360
Do you hate me?

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:43.990
Do you want to kill me?

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:00.420
How ugly.

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:05.970
It's a pity that we need to cling to
the treasure of these ugly beings.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.400
Impossible!

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:34.160
You're a filthy animal...

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:39.920
without an iota of elegance.

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:56.520
Come.

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.450
Why? Why did you keep it a secret?

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:11.120
Why?

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:42.400
<i>It was all due to my ego...</i>

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:47.530
<i>I thought saving a small wolf</i>
<i>who had lost his family and friends</i>

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:49.280
<i>would atone for my sins.</i>

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:55.790
<i>But I made you choose revenge</i>
<i>as your purpose in life.</i>

00:10:56.450 --> 00:11:00.500
I merely used you as a tool
to exact my personal revenge.

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:05.750
When all along I was actually
one of your enemies.

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:08.920
But I was fine with that.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:12.140
I accepted that
when you found out about everything

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:13.600
it would be my time to die.

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:16.810
Now is that time.

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:19.390
You can't be serious.

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:23.940
Is that all you're going to say
about the past 10 years?

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:29.530
I saw nothing but the blood of Sirius
before my eyes...

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:31.610
yet my hands stopped.

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:34.120
Do you know why?

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:38.450
You were my emotional support!

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:41.290
I regarded you as my father.

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:43.750
Yuliy.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:45.710
If I hadn't met you...

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.090
I would've died then and there.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:50.800
Because you were there,

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.760
I was able to live until now!

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:54.970
Why...?

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:59.180
Why did my mother
and the villagers have to die?

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:03.440
Why did my older brother
have to turn into a Vampire?

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:07.400
Is it all because of the Ark?

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:09.320
Please tell me, professor!

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:11.320
Professor Willard!

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:19.740
I need to know everything
as the only Sirius survivor.

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:29.050
DIRECTOR OF BUREAU OF MILITARY AFFAIRS

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:31.130
Major.

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:33.380
I was harshly reprimanded.

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:35.590
-So?
-Well...

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:39.510
As expected, no bodies were found
after the incident last night.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:41.600
The police are perplexed.

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:45.230
Corpses turning to ash might be confusing.

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:47.730
"Vampires", right?

00:12:48.360 --> 00:12:50.480
It's still hard for me to swallow...

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:54.530
I guess we at least exacted revenge
on behalf of Major General Kakizaki

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.700
and the soldiers.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:57.450
I hope so.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.280
So, what happens to the Kudan Branch now?

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:03.450
After exceeding my authority
in this incident, it'll be dissolved.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:05.960
I see. That's too bad.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:07.420
Sorry.

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.540
I'm returning to Harbin.

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:12.670
It's the price I have to pay
to evade court martial.

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:14.420
Haven't you heard?

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:18.720
You've been subpoenaed
for another account.

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:26.060
What the heck is this?

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:28.400
Sensei. Hello.

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:29.860
Miss!

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.110
The mansion, the dojo...

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:35.450
How is the Master?

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:38.870
He's fine, but he's resting in bed
after this traumatic experience.

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:40.990
That's understandable.

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:42.910
You'll be fine, Ryoko.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:47.460
V Shipping will pay for all the damage
to the mansion.

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:49.290
Really?

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:50.630
I'm jealous.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:54.010
I wish the Vampires would destroy
my shabby house back home too.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:56.840
-What the heck are you all talking about?
-Well...

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.510
What happened to Yuliy and Mr. Willard?

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:03.060
Well, now's not a real good time to...

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:11.860
I learned about the Ark of Sirius
while searching for Dogville.

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:16.990
The miraculous Ark had been protected
for generations by the Sirius tribe.

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:20.740
It was said that vast knowledge
and technology are packed in the Ark.

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:24.370
A crystal of wisdom for humanity,
if you will...

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:27.120
But it was merely a legend.

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:32.460
At the time, I was only interested
in finding out if it were true,

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:34.460
and not merely folklore.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.420
But that wasn't the case for them.

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:38.760
No.

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:42.300
There must be something
that the Vampires want

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:45.010
from the information and technology
the Ark contains.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:49.600
So, my father must have known
what the Ark was...

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:52.730
That's why he took it from the village.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.730
As far as I know...

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:58.740
the Ark must be protected
by someone of the Sirius bloodline.

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:03.490
If he's alive, it's highly probable
he's protecting the Ark somewhere.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:04.740
Otherwise...

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:08.960
"Do something that only you can do."

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:11.960
It's what Mikhail said to me.

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:15.250
He told me to do something
that only I can do

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.130
as the lone survivor of the Sirius.

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:21.380
If that is to protect the Ark of Sirius...

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:25.390
If that's what I can do
for my dead mother and family,

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.180
instead of killing Vampires...

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:30.390
I would like to search for the Ark.

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:32.190
I see.

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:35.480
But you probably don't have
a lot of time left.

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:38.070
Kershner...

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:40.530
He's merely a pawn.

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:44.240
The Vampire who truly wants the Ark is...

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.030
Yevgraf.

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:49.660
He must be the one
closest to the Ark right now.

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:10.100
From the east coast to the west coast.

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:12.770
It has spread almost completely.

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:17.520
Yes. The disease is on its way
to spread around the world.

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:23.860
The darkness of death
that spreads among our tribe.

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:25.820
Mr. Yev! Mr. Yev!

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:27.830
You have a message from Tokyo.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.540
-Kershner is dead.
-He's dead.

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:32.830
And Mikhail?

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:35.750
Misha is heading over here
with old Klarwein.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:36.670
That's right.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.670
I see.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.800
<i>Then there's no problem at all.</i>

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:52.350
Yuliy, I fixed your coat--

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:57.860
You guys help clean up for one second,
and already you're tired out?

00:16:58.110 --> 00:17:00.780
I worked hard,
considering what happened yesterday.

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.650
Plus, I'm injured.

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.820
-Oh, you're hurt too right, Yuliy?
-Yes.

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:07.530
It's not that bad.

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:10.870
I bet. Your body isn't normal.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:12.290
Right.

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:14.870
I'm hungry. Where's the professor?

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:18.170
He left saying that he needed
to contact headquarters.

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:37.850
Hey.

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.900
I owe a lot to the owner here.

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:43.110
I've come to pay him respect.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:46.030
You're surprisingly sincere.

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:48.030
What now?

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:53.540
Are you going to chase Vampires,
or go look for the Ark of Sirius?

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:59.580
That would be something that could affect
the imminent survival of our empire.

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:01.840
Are you saying
such a thing actually exists?

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.960
I understand your skepticism.

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:06.800
But if, for example,

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.880
I told you that Vampires didn't exist,

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:11.220
what would your counter-argument be?

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:16.020
Captain Mamoru Akasaka.

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:21.400
He was on a secret mission
to find and obtain the Ark of Sirius.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.440
But 15 years ago,

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:26.320
he went missing in Central Asia.

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:27.530
Since then,

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:32.240
the turmoil of the War in Europe
kept us from continuing the search.

00:18:32.530 --> 00:18:35.200
But, taking into account
recent global economic panic,

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:37.500
and our affairs in Manchuria and Mongolia,

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:39.370
we will restart the search.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.000
Major Iba.

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:43.790
I need you to take the place
of Captain Akasaka

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:46.460
and search for the Ark of Sirius
in secret,

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:50.890
and obtain it
before any other country does.

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:54.140
Having the Ark or not

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:56.890
will significantly affect
the future of our empire.

00:18:57.680 --> 00:18:59.600
I know it's hard for you to believe.

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:02.980
Why would you choose me
for such an important mission?

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:06.400
Also, there is too little information
to work with at the moment.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:07.900
In V Shipping...

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:11.110
A man referred to as a Jaeger...

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:14.740
A man named Willard,
with whom you have made contact...

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:18.500
I hear he was well known
in the academic world

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:20.830
as the pioneer of research
on Sirius folklore.

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:25.420
I know about how you mobilized the unit
in the Naoe Residence.

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:28.760
No wonder you're the future
of the intelligence unit.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:31.840
I imagine you're already friends with him.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:37.100
Helping you got me into this mess.

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:39.770
I'm sorry about that.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:43.100
If you mean that,
you could repay me a bit.

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:46.110
Do you know this man?

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:47.780
No.

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:50.650
But there's something I do know...

00:19:51.610 --> 00:19:54.530
The Vampires are also after
the Ark of Sirius.

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:56.410
What?

00:19:57.030 --> 00:20:00.750
I just reported to headquarters
that I've completed my mission in Japan,

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:04.630
and in doing so,
I've received information that Yevgraf,

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:07.710
the Vampire who's after the Ark,
has been seen in Sakhalin.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:08.840
Sakhalin?

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:12.590
Enough to say we're even now, Major Iba?

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:14.720
More than enough.

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:17.350
By the way, Mr. Willard...

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.970
have you had enough
of looking for the Ark?

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:24.770
Yes. Looking for the Ark
isn't my priority at the moment.

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:27.440
That's too bad.

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:34.860
Yevgraf.

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.320
Haven't heard of him.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:41.000
So, are we going to this place
called Sakhalin?

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:44.580
No. A detached force
is already heading that way.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:48.540
We were ordered to return
back to London once.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.130
London?

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.920
Haven't been to Europe in a while.

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:54.760
But wouldn't it be faster
for us to get to Sakhalin,

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:56.590
geographically speaking?

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:59.430
The order from headquarters is final.

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:01.520
What's wrong, Yuliy?

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:03.140
Nothing.

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:05.850
What, you don't like my country?
Is that it?

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:07.860
They could at least have better food.

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:10.230
What?
Like it's any different in your country.

00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:12.230
It's totally different.

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:57.880
YOKOHAMA-SAKHALIN

00:22:58.220 --> 00:23:01.390
<i>It's not that I've come to dislike</i>
<i>the world of Jaegers,</i>

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:02.890
<i>or being with everyone.</i>

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:05.310
<i>It's just that...</i>

00:23:07.350 --> 00:23:11.310
<i>I've found what it is</i>
<i>I absolutely must do.</i>

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:30.160
<i>Yuliy, we work as a "pack"...</i>

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:33.960
<i>And we chase our prey endlessly,</i>

00:23:34.290 --> 00:23:36.460
corner them against the wall,
and kill them.

00:23:36.630 --> 00:23:38.210
<i>That is our job.</i>

00:23:39.720 --> 00:23:41.840
<i>I liked the idea of a pack like that.</i>

00:23:43.930 --> 00:23:47.600
<i>But this, I must do alone.</i>

00:23:49.980 --> 00:23:51.640
So, I'll go.

00:23:54.270 --> 00:23:57.900
EPISODE 7
TRUE CONFESSION

00:24:02.780 --> 00:24:06.950
<i>-An eternal seal that nobody could break.</i>
<i>-Are you really a Jaeger?</i>

00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:10.200
<i>-Would you like to be a Vampire, too?</i>
<i>-Don't get in my way!</i>

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:11.910
EPISODE 8
THE SANCTUARY OF SIRIUS

00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:17.000
Subtitle translation by Kozo Komori
